{"type":"message","id":"b6ea7763","parentId":"cd303bd0","timestamp":"2026-03-20T21:57:19.853Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking at my history, I can see that I keep spawning the coder agent but they're not appearing in the subagents list. The sessions are being created but then disappearing immediately. This suggests there might be an issue with how I'm spawning them - perhaps the mode or runtime isn't correct for a persistent coder session.\n\nLet me try spawning the coder agent with the correct parameters for a persistent session that will stay alive and do actual work. The key issue might be that I need to use `mode: \"session\"` instead of `mode: \"run\"` for persistent work.\n</think>\n\nI see the problem - my coder spawns are disappearing immediately. Looking at the history, I've been spawning them but they're not staying alive. Let me try spawning with the correct persistent mode:\n\n<tool_call>\n<function=sessions_spawn>\n<parameter=agentId>\ncoder\n</parameter>\n<parameter=deliver>\nfalse\n</parameter>\n<parameter=mode>\nsession\n</parameter>\n<parameter=runtime>\nacp\n</parameter>\n<parameter=task>\nBuild a live football score dashboard from livesport.cz:\n\nREQUIRED:\n- Scrape livesport.cz for LIVE football matches (all leagues, all countries"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774043809710}}
